<ParentName>PreDist Modem Constants OverRide</ParentName><Description>DAC Scaling parameter used to process captured IQ Data. For NikeL based Targets Value = 4.</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>PreDist Limits</Name><Value /><Unit>NONE</Unit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>PreDist Calibration</ParentName><Description>Predistortion Calibration Limits</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>PreDist:Expected Peak to Average</Name><Value>1.5</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Double</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><Description>Sanity Check: Minimum Expected Peak to Average Power- Calibration will fail if the max power of the waveform is less than"PreDist:Expected Peak to Average"+"PreDist:Power of Calibation RGI"</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>PreDist:Min Power Limit in EDGE Duration</Name><Value>-20</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Double</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><Description>Sanity Check: Minimum Expected Power (dBm) - Calibration will fail if the min power of the waveform is less than the specified power</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Delay Limit</Name><Value>-99999</Value><Unit>Samples</Unit><UpperLimit>100</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>-50</LowerLimit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Output</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><EnableDataLoggingAsString>T</EnableDataLoggingAsString><Description>A limit on the measured delay between the expected and calibrated waveform</Description><Constraints>PreDist Limits</Constraints><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>NonIQ PreDist Calibration</Name><Value /><Unit>NONE</Unit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Input</Ty