e><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>Disable</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>Disable</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>Determines if NV should be logged to XML output, completely independent of NV writing.</Description><Constraints>Disable;Enable</Constraints><DisplayHint>8</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>NV Options</Name><Value /><Unit>NONE</Unit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>NV Options ITEMS ROOT</Description></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Load GSM Power Char Tables to Phone</Name><Value>0</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>On enablement, APT Tables, Cal Vcc Tables and Call Vcc Tables will be loaded to phone based on PA id</Description><DisplayHint>5378</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Write New Chain Enumerated NV</Name><Value>1</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>No</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>No</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>Flag to specify whether to write to legacy NV or New Chain Enumerated (C0,C2 etc) NV</Description><DisplayHint>5378</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Write to Extended RGI NV Type</Name><Value>0</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>Flag to specify whether to write to legacy NV type or Extended RGI list NV type</Description><DisplayHint>5378</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Write to Tx Consolidated NV</Name><Value>0</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>Flag to specify whether to write to consolidates Tx NV or not</Description><Constraints>False=0;V1=1;V2=2;V3=3;</Constraints><DisplayHint>8</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Chain Enumerated NV Version</Name><Value>0</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>Chain Enumerated NV version. </Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Obtain NV Container from UUT</Name><Value>0</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>false - write Tx NV data to container specified by "Tx Chain ID Selection"true  - write Tx NV data to container specified by the UUT</Description><DisplayHint>5378</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Data Src For Env Gain Data</Name><Value>1</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NV Options</ParentName><Description>Data Src For Env Gain Data.
0 - legacy , readback from NVs LINEAR_TX_GAIN_PARAM and CHAR_PREDIST_ENV_GAIN (Default)
