eak to Average</Name><Value>1</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Double</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><Description>Sanity Check: Minimum Expected Peak to Average Power- Calibration will fail if the max power of the waveform is less than"PreDist:Expected Peak to Average"+"PreDist:Power of Calibation RGI"</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>PreDist:Min Power Limit in EDGE Duration</Name><Value>-20</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Double</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><Description>Sanity Check: Minimum Expected Power (dBm) - Calibration will fail if the min power of the waveform is less than the specified power</Description><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Delay Limit</Name><Value>-99999</Value><Unit>Samples</Unit><UpperLimit>100</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>-50</LowerLimit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Output</Type><ParentName>PreDist Limits</ParentName><EnableDataLoggingAsString>T</EnableDataLoggingAsString><Description>A limit on the measured delay between the expected and calibrated waveform</Description><Constraints>PreDist Limits</Constraints><DisplayHint>1024</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>NonIQ PreDist Calibration</Name><Value /><Unit>NONE</Unit><DataType>String</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>NonIQ Pre Distortion Calibration ITEMS ROOT</Description></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Perform NonIQ PreDistortion Calibration</Name><Value>0</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>Disable</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>Disable</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>NonIQ PreDist Calibration</ParentName><Description>Determines if Predistortion calibration for high power EDGE should be performed.</Description><Constraints>Disable;Enable</Constraints><DisplayHint>8</DisplayHint></