arameterCls><Name>NV Log Enable</Name><Value>1</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>Disable</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>Disable</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>Determines if NV should be logged to XML output, completely independent of NV writing.</Description><Constraints>Disable;Enable</Constraints><DisplayHint>8</DisplayHint></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Rx Chain ID Selection</Name><Value>0</Value><Unit>NONE</Unit><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>Specify which Rx chain to calibrate.
0 - use C0
2 - use C2
NOTE: must enable Write New Chain Enumerated NV to use C2
</Description></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Rx Antenna Path Selection</Name><Value>65535</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>Specify which Rx antenna path to calibrate. Use only with Set Device and SigPath version V1.</Description></ParameterCls><ParameterCls><Name>Set Device and SigPath</Name><Value>0</Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><Description>Set Device and SigPath
