/Value><UpperLimit>0</UpperLimit><LowerLimit>0</LowerLimit><DataType>Int</DataType><Type>Input</Type><ParentName>RxDiversity</ParentName><Description>false - dont do diversitytrue - do diversityNOTE: must enable Write New Chain Enumerated NV for this cal
